=== CHRISTMAS PUDDING ===\
=== CHRISTMAS PUDDING OUTLINE ===\
\
\
Keith Bates / K-Type Freebie 2022 (version 1.0)\
www.k-type.com    -    info@k-type.com\
\
\
Christmas Pudding and Christmas Pudding Outline are small caps fonts based on label lettering from a Christmas Pudding produced by the London Transport Food Production Centre, circa 1970.\
\
The two fonts have matching spacing and kerning so can be overlapped to create bicolor artwork.\
\
